<decision #track.conditional_decision_activation.graph_nodes apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { status = "accepted" blocks = [] durable_candidate = true } (
  <question ?01M02EGVBJC3R5EHYAPNFSSTK9>
  How should a combination of decisions create a new planning question?
  </?01M02EGVBJC3R5EHYAPNFSSTK9>
  <answer ?01M02EGVBJC3R5EHYAPNFSSTKA>
